          "arguments": "{\"summary\": \"Opponent sacrificed 3 Clues to pump the crewed Fire Nation Drill to 9/6 trample and attacked with it plus two Ally tokens (12 total vs my 10hp). Blocking the Drill with Geyser Leaper is the only way to survive: 3 damage kills my Leaper, 6 tramples over, plus 3 from tokens = 9, leaving me at 1 life.\", \"blockers\": \"p59:p16\", \"rationale\": \"Must block the 9/6 trampler or I die (12 incoming > 10 life). Chumping with Geyser Leaper lets only 6 trample through for 9 total — I survive at 1 and hope to rebuild.\"}",
