      "reasoning": "Excellent draw! Octopus Form is an instant — I can cast Fortune Teller now for a blocker + new Clue, then chump the Drill and untap that blocker with Octopus Form to block a token too, surviving at 1 life again. Katara can't block enough power, so Fortune Teller it is.",
