      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "Opponent attacked with the 9/6 trampling Drill and three 1/1 Ally tokens while I'm at 1 life with only Forecasting Fortune Teller as a blocker. Blocking the Drill is the best available block — even with Octopus Form (2/4), 5 tramples through plus 3 from tokens is lethal regardless, so the game is lost, but I'll make the block.",
