        "rationale": "Blocking the Drill with Fortune Teller is the only meaningful block. Even with Octopus Form pumped to 2/4, 5 trample + 3 token damage is lethal at 1 life — there's no surviving line, but I block to minimize the damage and finish the game cleanly.",
      },
